Licence
-------

Ken Silverman's licence allows derivative works of the Ken's Labyrinth source
to be distributed only through the Internet and free of charge, with no
commercial exploitation.  For that reason this archive must not be put on
Aminet CD-ROMs or any other media that are sold.
